{"_id":"68d3e45c166b018f83df5ed8","roadmapSlug":"html","nodeId":"ksKI4TDz4_9IcmNORczWo","description":"# Textual Tags\n\nTextual tags in HTML are used to structure and format text content on a webpage. They define how text should appear, whether it's a paragraph, heading, emphasized word, or a quoted section. These tags provide semantic meaning to the text, helping browsers and search engines understand the content's organization and purpose.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"HTML Text Formatting Elements","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/text-level_semantics","_id":"6a71e295b0650226a59f1b12"},{"type":"article","title":"HTML Text Tags Overview","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/html/html_formatting.asp","_id":"6a71e295b0650226a59f1b13"},{"type":"article","title":"Semantic HTML for Text","url":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/semantic-html5-elements/","_id":"6a71e295b0650226a59f1b14"}],"createdAt":"2025-09-24T12:30:20.559Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-04T13:01:09.024Z","lessonPacks":[{"_id":"6a10b41ba95e0d5c68dede2f","title":"HTML Fundamentals","slug":"html","description":"Enough HTML to read, write, inspect, and understand real web pages.","lessonIds":["6a0da437a95e0d5c68ded033","6a0ef00da95e0d5c68ded162","6a0f1366a95e0d5c68ded2b4","6a0f2262a95e0d5c68ded32a","6a0f33e7a95e0d5c68ded463","6a102d2fa95e0d5c68ded758","6a106a2ba95e0d5c68deda00","6a107b29a95e0d5c68deda53"],"projectIds":["68b7185fffbff9183d772aea","68b7185fffbff9183d772aeb","6a1485bfac1c5fa9928a2087","6a1485c5ac1c5fa9928a2093","6a1485cbac1c5fa9928a2099","6a1485d1ac1c5fa9928a20a4"],"featuredImage":"","readingTime":58,"lessonCount":8,"quizCount":0,"projectCount":6}],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/html/content/ksKI4TDz4_9IcmNORczWo.md"}